      "source_image_index": null,
      "ownership": "question"
    },
    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "The distance between points P(x1, y1, z1) and Q(x2, y2, z2) is given by the formula: d = \\sqrt{(x2 - x1)^2 + (y2 - y1)^2 + (z2 - z1)^2}.",
    "answer_latex": "d = \\sqrt{(x_2 - x_1)^2 + (y_2 - y_1)^2 + (z_2 - z_1)^2}",
